    "設定 › 一般 › 鍵盤，並打開「允許完整取用」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings › General › Keyboard, then turn on Allow Full Access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定存在 Stick 上。睡著的 Stick 按住就醒，醒來就開始錄，連上手機後再送出。說話聽不清楚就把收音調高，破音就調低。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These settings live on the Stick. Hold a sleeping Stick to wake it: it starts recording at once and sends when the phone connects. Raise mic gain if speech is faint, lower it if it distorts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
